* **Note:** It's possible for a player to fake the value returned from getPlayerSerial when used on the clientside. For this reason you should only trust the value returned by this function when used serverside. 

{{Important Note|You should *use this function* in conjunction *with account system* (e.g: *login &amp; password*) - especially for critical things, because *serials could be invalid* (as in, *non-unique* or *faked*). See: [https://wiki.multitheftauto.com/wiki/Script_security Script security].}}

