setVehicleDamageProof.description:
This functions makes a vehicle damage proof, so it won't take damage from bullets, hits, explosions or fire. A damage proof's vehicle health can still be changed via script.

{{Note | Setting a bike damage proof will have the side-effect of peds not being able to get knocked off anymore, even if [setPedCanBeKnockedOffBike](https://wiki.multitheftauto.com/wiki/setPedCanBeKnockedOffBike) is set to true.

Consider using and cancelling the [onVehicleDamage](https://wiki.multitheftauto.com/wiki/onVehicleDamage) / [onClientVehicleDamage](https://wiki.multitheftauto.com/wiki/onClientVehicleDamage) events instead.}}

