* **Note:** To prevent memory leaks, ensure each call to [xmlCreateFile](https://wiki.multitheftauto.com/wiki/xmlCreateFile) has a matching call to [xmlUnloadFile](https://wiki.multitheftauto.com/wiki/xmlUnloadFile)

{{Tip|If you do not want to share the content of the created file with other servers, prepend the file path with @ (See [filepath](https://wiki.multitheftauto.com/wiki/filepath) for more information)}}

