{{Tip|Although this function works in no-3D sounds (those created by [playSound](https://wiki.multitheftauto.com/wiki/playSound)), it only makes sense to use it with 3D sounds (created by [playSound3D](https://wiki.multitheftauto.com/wiki/playSound3D)). Please refer to [setSoundPanningEnabled](https://wiki.multitheftauto.com/wiki/setSoundPanningEnabled) for a explanation of what this property does.}}

