}}

* **Note:** There is a tool available which allows you to find bank and sound IDs easily: [https://community.mtasa.com/index.php?p=resources&amp;s=details&amp;id=7549 sfxBrowser:Download](https://wiki.multitheftauto.com/wiki/https://community.mtasa.com/index.php?p=resources&amp;s=details&amp;id=7549 sfxBrowser:Download). 

