isVehicleWheelOnGround.description:
{{New feature/item|3.0156|1.5.5|11854|

This function returns a [boolean](https://wiki.multitheftauto.com/wiki/boolean) whether the [vehicle](https://wiki.multitheftauto.com/wiki/vehicle)'s wheel is on ground (true) or in air (false).

}}

* **Note:** In vehicles with 3 wheels, the wheels are combined 2 in 1, in motorbikes only the left - &lt;code&gt;"front_left"&lt;/code&gt; and &lt;code&gt;"rear_left"&lt;/code&gt;

